@NovaWallet_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Mint a dev JWT for a customer
POST {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-001"
}

### Create a wallet for the caller identified by the bearer token (paste the access_token from above)
POST {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### Get wallet balance (paste the walletId from the create response)
GET {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Look up the same wallet by its customer-facing account number instead
GET {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/wallets/by-account-number/{{accountNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Simulate a third-party (interbank/NIP) credit landing in a wallet, addressed by account number
POST {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/transactions/external-inbound
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "amountKobo": 150000
}

### Transfer between two wallets — FromWalletId is your own wallet's id (from the create
### response), ToAccountNumber is the recipient's account number (from their create response)
POST {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/transactions/internal-transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "fromWalletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "toAccountNumber": "{{recipientAccountNumber}}",
  "amountKobo": 5000
}

### Debit your own wallet to simulate an outbound third-party (interbank/NIP) transfer
### (paste the returned transactionId below to simulate a reversal)
POST {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/transactions/external-outbound
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "amountKobo": 5000
}

### Simulate the NIP switch reporting that the outbound transfer above failed, reversing it
POST {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/transactions/external-outbound/{{transactionId}}/reversal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND"
}

### Get the wallet's transaction history, newest first
GET {{NovaWallet_HostAddress}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
